                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR BILDVERARBEITUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET DISPOSITIF DE TRAITEMENT D'IMAGE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND DEVICE FOR PROCESSING IMAGE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method includes: obtaining a plurality of view images; identifying a representative value from among difference values between values of a plurality of sub-pixels corresponding to a first position in the plurality of view images and an intermediate value of a bit range of a display; determining filtering strength corresponding to the representative value, based on a correspondence map indicating a correspondence relationship between filtering strength and a difference value between a value of a sub-pixel and the intermediate value; and applying a filter having the determined filtering strength to the plurality of sub-pixels corresponding to the first position, wherein a value resulting from applying the filter having the determined filtering strength to the plurality of sub-pixels corresponding to the first position is included in a range of sub-pixel values according to the bit range of the display.</p>
            </abstract>
